  "dataSourceInstructions": "Use `fact_green_tripdata` to gather the data for analysis.\r\nFilter with given parameters from the user.\r\n\r\nThe `dim_paymenttype` table provides the type information of patment_type.\r\n\r\nThe `dim_weekday` table provides the weekday name.\r\n\r\nThe `dim_location` table provides the location name of the dropoff_LocationID and pickup_LocationID.",
  "displayName": "LH_NYC_TAXI_FOR_AI",
  "type": "lakehouse_tables",
  "userDescription": "This data source contains Green Taxi Trip data from 2009 year through 2024 year. This data is provided by from NYC Taxi.\r\nEach row represents one trip in one passenger engagement.\r\n\r\n- passenger_count: The number of people in the passenger of the trip.\r\n- total_amount: The total amount charged to passenger.\r\n- payment_type: The type of payment (Card=1,Cash=2).\r\n- trip_distance: The trip distance from pickup location to dropoff location.\r\n- trip_duration: The time taken in the trip.\r\n- pickup_date: The date when the passenger was picked up (UTC).\r\n- dropoff_date: The date when the passenger was dropped off (UTC).\r\n- pickup_LocationID: The locaton id of pickup (see dim_location table).\r\n- dropoff_LocationID: The locaton id of drop-off (see dim_location table).\r\n",
